{{also|bahn}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|ban}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|*bana}}, ultimately from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*banō}}. Cognate with [[bane]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[baːn]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Bahn.ogg|Audio (Austria)|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|aːn|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Bahnen}}

# [[route]], [[trail]]
#: {{ux|de|Sie bricht ihre eigene '''Bahn'''.|translation=She blazes her own '''trail'''.}}
# [[rail transport]]
#: {{ux|de|Ich habe eine Tageskarte für Bus und '''Bahn'''.|translation=I've got a day ticket for bus and '''rail'''.}}
# [[train]], [[tram]]
#: {{ux|de|Die '''Bahn''' kommt immer zu spät!|translation=The '''train''' is always late!}}
# [[lane]]
# {{label|de|astronomy}} [[orbit]]
#: {{ux|de|Kometen umlaufen die Sonne auf sehr exzentrischen '''Bahnen'''.|translation=Comets orbit the Sun on very eccentric '''orbits'''.}}

